      "statement": "The bootstrap flow downloads the CA root over an insecure client, validates it against the supplied fingerprint, writes it to pki.GetRootCAPath() with mode 0600, persists ca-url/fingerprint/root into defaults.json, optionally registers and activates a context, and with --install adds the root to the system trust store via smallstep/truststore.",
